{"game":"Equilinox","source":"custom","apworld":"equilinox.apworld","world_version":null,"groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"}]},{"name":"Goal Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"goal_selection","name":"Goal","kind":"choice","doc":"Completion condition","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"completionist","label":"Completionist","id":0},{"value":"evolve_camel","label":"Evolve Camel","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"completionist","doc_fr":"État d ' achèvement"}]},{"name":"Gameplay Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"free_evolution","name":"Free Evolution","kind":"toggle","doc":"Removes the DP cost from evolution. Other requirements\nstill must be fulfilled.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true","doc_fr":"Supprime le coût du PDD de l'évolution. D'autres exigences doivent encore être remplies."}]},{"name":"DP Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"tasks_reward_dp","name":"Tasks Reward DP","kind":"toggle","doc":"Should tasks reward the normal DP amount upon completion.\nIf off, some filler DP items are replaced with larger\nsums of DP to replace the missing task rewards.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true","doc_fr":"Si les tâches récompensent le PDD normal une fois terminé.\nSi non, certains éléments DP de remplissage sont remplacés par des sommes plus importantes de DP pour remplacer les récompenses de tâches manquantes."},{"key":"starting_dp","name":"Starting DP Balance","kind":"range","doc":"Starting DP Balance. The vanilla value is 2500.\nThis is not exact; you will start with a balance *near* the selected value.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":2500,"max":100000,"default":5000,"doc_fr":"Début de l'équilibre PDD. La valeur de la vanille est 2500.\nCe n'est pas exact ; vous commencerez par un solde *près de* la valeur sélectionnée."},{"key":"itempool_dp","name":"Additional DP in Itempool","kind":"range","doc":"How much DP should be in the itempool? Note, currently the only filler\nitem is small amounts of DP, so there will be more than just this much\nin the item pool. This option allows you to force the addition of larger\nDP items to the pool. If 'Tasks Reward DP' is off, some larger DP amounts\nwill have already been added. We recommend at least some additional DP,\nsince you may receive expensive Species before having a lot of DP earn per minute.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":500000,"default":150000,"doc_fr":"Combien de DP devrait être dans le pool item? Remarque, actuellement le seul élément de remplissage est de petites quantités de DP, il y aura donc plus que cela dans le pool d'articles. Cette option vous permet de forcer l'ajout d'éléments DP plus grands au pool. Si 'Tâches Récompenses DP' est éteint, des montants plus importants de PDD auront déjà été ajoutés. Nous vous recommandons au moins quelques PDD supplémentaires, car vous pouvez recevoir des espèces coûteuses avant d'avoir beaucoup de PDD gagner par minute."}]},{"name":"Trait Checks","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"size_checks","name":"Include Size Checks","kind":"toggle","doc":"Adds checks for breeding species of size 1.10 and 1.20.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true","doc_fr":"Ajoute des contrôles pour les espèces reproductrices de taille 1.10 et 1.20."}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000,"doc_fr":"Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}</p>\n"},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_location_hints","name":"Start Location Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these location